    "I enjoy greatest-hits collections, but that format alone does not mean I will enjoy the artist or sound.",
    "Both Neil Diamond collections interest me, but my interest in his songs does not mean I want two overlapping collections at once."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The connection to the harmonies and songwriting I enjoy in Simon & Garfunkel and Melanie matters more to my next choice than simply being older music.",
    "My recent Christmas listening makes another holiday album relevant, but the artist still matters, and I would choose the strongest folk-pop matches first."
